WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.075 --> 00:00:01.945
- Are you vegan?

00:00:01.945 --> 00:00:02.828
Good.

00:00:02.828 --> 00:00:07.374
(classical music)

00:00:07.374 --> 00:00:08.334
- I don't think I've ever touched

00:00:08.334 --> 00:00:09.884
a single vegan food in my life,

00:00:09.884 --> 00:00:11.169
except like by accident.

00:00:11.169 --> 00:00:12.504
- I usually do like vegan food.

00:00:12.504 --> 00:00:15.799
- I'm skeptical of these vegan desserts.

00:00:15.799 --> 00:00:17.676
- This is the vegan glazed doughnut,

00:00:17.676 --> 00:00:19.469
but I hear the word doughnut,

00:00:19.469 --> 00:00:20.262
and I'm on board.

00:00:20.262 --> 00:00:21.889
- It looks like a regular doughnut.

00:00:21.889 --> 00:00:23.223
- It doesn't smell like a doughnut.

00:00:23.223 --> 00:00:25.225
It smells like a lemon square.

00:00:25.225 --> 00:00:25.892
- Oh, this is good.

00:00:25.892 --> 00:00:26.601
- That's terrible.

00:00:26.601 --> 00:00:28.270
- This kinda tastes
like fruit loops to me.

00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:29.898
- If I was having this and
you told me it was vegan,

00:00:29.898 --> 00:00:31.189
I would not believe it.

00:00:31.189 --> 00:00:32.315
- Yes for the vegan doughnut.

00:00:32.315 --> 00:00:34.443
I'm liking it.

00:00:34.443 --> 00:00:37.320
- Tofu vegan cheesecake? (disgusted noise)

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:39.573
- It's more wiggly than
regular cheesecake.

00:00:39.573 --> 00:00:42.524
- It does not smell
like cheesecake at all.

00:00:42.524 --> 00:00:43.535
- Mmm.

00:00:43.535 --> 00:00:44.287
- No.

00:00:44.287 --> 00:00:45.413
- It's really gritty.

00:00:45.413 --> 00:00:46.455
- The texture's awful.

00:00:46.455 --> 00:00:47.956
- Or like soaked, mushy bread.

00:00:47.956 --> 00:00:50.584
- I could not describe to
you what this taste is,

00:00:50.584 --> 00:00:53.045
I can just tell you that
it's working for me.

00:00:53.045 --> 00:00:54.630
- It's like eating a giant tofu

00:00:54.630 --> 00:00:55.964
with a lotta sugar in it.

00:00:55.964 --> 00:00:57.340
- Why call it cheesecake

00:00:57.340 --> 00:00:59.593
if it's not gonna taste like cheesecake?

00:00:59.593 --> 00:01:02.345
- The more that I have
it, the more I like it.

00:01:02.345 --> 00:01:03.889
- Vegan snickerdoodle.

00:01:03.889 --> 00:01:05.808
I'm feeling good about
these snickerdoodles.

00:01:05.808 --> 00:01:07.017
- These are so soft.

00:01:07.017 --> 00:01:08.018
- They look like rocks.

00:01:08.018 --> 00:01:11.809
- All vegan desserts look like dirt.

00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:13.648
- Oh yeah.

00:01:13.648 --> 00:01:14.816
- It tastes gingery.

00:01:14.816 --> 00:01:15.742
- These win.

00:01:15.742 --> 00:01:17.534
- It's mushy. It's just
not working for me.

00:01:17.534 --> 00:01:18.487
- Cookies should crumble

00:01:18.487 --> 00:01:21.740
and I can mold this into any shape I want.

00:01:21.740 --> 00:01:23.116
- Vegan cherry ice cream.

00:01:23.116 --> 00:01:25.412
It looks like a regular
piece of ice cream,

00:01:25.412 --> 00:01:26.870
except it's really hard.

00:01:26.870 --> 00:01:28.747
- There are little pieces
of chocolate in it.

00:01:28.747 --> 00:01:30.540
- Smells like ice cream.

00:01:30.540 --> 00:01:31.500
- It's really good.

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:32.417
- That sucks.

00:01:32.417 --> 00:01:33.418
- That's super fruity.

00:01:33.418 --> 00:01:35.754
- It tastes kinda like cherry
flavored Bubblicious gum.

00:01:35.754 --> 00:01:36.755
- Knowing that it's vegan,

00:01:36.755 --> 00:01:37.839
it tastes fresher.

00:01:37.839 --> 00:01:39.049
- Here's the thing,

00:01:39.049 --> 00:01:43.303
I would probably eat any
dessert no matter what.

00:01:43.303 --> 00:01:44.554
- Raw vegan brownie.

00:01:44.554 --> 00:01:46.307
Looks like a brownie with seeds in it.

00:01:46.307 --> 00:01:47.557
- It looks like a granola bar.

00:01:47.557 --> 00:01:50.830
- Nothing about this
screams brownie to me.

00:01:50.830 --> 00:01:52.187
- That's delicious.

00:01:52.187 --> 00:01:53.231
- I don't like it.

00:01:53.231 --> 00:01:54.147
- It's definitely chocolatey.

00:01:54.147 --> 00:01:55.315
- It tastes exactly like a Cliff bar.

00:01:55.315 --> 00:01:56.691
- Mushy texture seems to be

00:01:56.691 --> 00:01:58.777
a running theme through vegan desserts.

00:01:58.777 --> 00:01:59.736
- I would eat it again.

00:01:59.736 --> 00:02:01.280
- I wish vegan foods
would just stop trying

00:02:01.280 --> 00:02:03.073
to imitate non vegan foods.

00:02:03.073 --> 00:02:04.825
Just be yourself.

00:02:04.825 --> 00:02:06.702
Be whatever it is that you are.

00:02:06.702 --> 00:02:10.731
(classical music)

